 player, use this:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Variables"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Settings → OmaThemes"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- Appearance (Light / Dark / System), themes (duh), and corner shapes (squircle/square)\n- Follows yo"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ur Omarchy desktop theme if used with the Omarchy Theme Sync browser extension"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Settings → OmaPixel"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Pixel field: _Off_, _Ambient_ (only the background animations), or _Interactive_ (cursor glow and "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"press-to-stamp).\n- Headline: _Loop_ forever or just play _Once_"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- docs/how-it-works.md: technical details for nerds and clankers\n- docs/contributing.md\n- CREDITS.md"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Credits"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- DHH) (duh) and his beautiful creation **Omarchy**: the themes, the hero field, the headline rotati"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"on and the music card are all ports of omarchy.org's own front end.\n- DeepSeek Harness (also duh): E"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"verything is a plugin, just like OmaSeek\n- *We Can Fix Everything (The Ultimate Machine)* by Kevin K"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"hing is a plugin, just like OmaSeek\n- *We Can Fix Everything (The Ultimate Machine)* by Kevin Koontz"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
